content": " Asking for and Giving Directions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you ask for directions you use question words.<br><br>When you give directions, you use prepositions of place like <span class=\"italic\">in, on, at, on</span> and <span class=\"italic\">in front of</span>.<br>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Where do I board?<br> <span class=\"strong\">Concierge </span>: You can board at Emperor's Canal.<br> <span class=\"strong\">Tom </span>: How do I get there?<br> <span class=\"strong\">Concierge</span> : When you are in front of the hotel, turn right. Walk down Pathe Street to Rokin.<br>  <span class=\"strong\">Tom </span>: Rokin Street?<br><span class=\"strong\">Concierge: </span>Yes. The HRH sits in the canal on Rokin Street.<br>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Ask for Directions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Give Directions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Where?<br>   <br>How do I get there?<br>   <br>Rokin Street?<br></span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">How do I get <span class = \\\"strong\\\">to</span>...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">at </span> Emperor's Canal.<br>   <br>When you are <span class=\\\"strong\\\">in front of</span> the hotel, turn right.<br>  <br><span class=\\\"strong\\\">in</span> the canal <span class=\\\"strong\\\">on</span> Rokin Street<br></span><br/><span class = \\\"italic\\\">To get <span class = \\\"strong\\\">to</span> the stadium, turn left</span>.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cozy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "comfortable and warm"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It a small cozy dining room with 16 places."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about a small boat cruise."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "deck"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a floor between the sides of a ship or boat  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can sit on the deck of the boat and look at the city."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "private"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not open to the general public "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He has a private jet to use when he wants."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to inquire "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to ask about  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can you inquire about the tour for me?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "exactly "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "completely accurate  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This is exactly the trip I want."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "prince"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "son of a king or queen "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This boat is named after Prince Heinrich."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le10ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le10ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Make a plan to go on a boat tour from a hotel."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue requesting help from the Concierge at the hotel. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "He gives you information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask for directions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your dialogue with your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about plans for a tour."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make requests for information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I respond to requests."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask for and give directions."}]}], "type": "sena"}